Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 02:27:30 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 30/68] Translations: remaining texts found by walking the
 integrated environment

Sketch tools toolbar name; plain Japanese for the Std_Part tooltip and the
reorient-sketch tooltip (no internal names); the leave-sketch tooltip no
longer claims that Escape leaves the sketch, which is not the case in the
integrated environment.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
